    "signature": "fn simplify_const_expr(expr: std::sync::Arc<dyn PhysicalExpr>) -> datafusion_common::Result<datafusion_common::tree_node::Transformed<std::sync::Arc<dyn PhysicalExpr>>>",
    "docs": "Simplify expressions that consist only of literals by evaluating them.\n\nThis function checks if all children of the given expression are literals.\nIf so, it evaluates the expression against a dummy RecordBatch and returns\nthe result as a new Literal.\n\n# Example transformations\n- `1 + 2` -> `3`\n- `(1 + 2) * 3` -> `9` (with bottom-up traversal)\n- `'hello' || ' world'` -> `'hello world'`",
